- New version allocation algorithm.
- Confirmation that no advance PC assignment remains.
- Lab-specific recovery credential implementation.
- Session-specific unlock credential implementation.
- Lab Server synchronisation changes.
- Student Portal integration contracts required.
- COE API contracts prepared for the Java backend.
- Tests completed and their results.
- Features still requiring backend or Lab Server implementation.

